graph TD
    %% Actors and System Boundaries
    UserNode((User))
    Browser[Web Browser]
    Server[Flask Server / App.py]
    Engine[Forward Chaining Engine]
    KB[(Knowledge Base / CSVs)]
    LLM[AI / LLM Service]

    %% Flow 1: Initialization
    UserNode -->|Visits Website| Browser
    Browser -->|GET Request| Server
    Server -->|Load Questions and Rules| KB
    KB -->|Return Data| Server
    Server -->|Render Dashboard| Browser

    %% Flow 2: Taking Quiz
    UserNode -->|Clicks Mulai Tes| Browser
    Browser -->|GET /quiz| Server
    Server -->|Render Quiz Page| Browser
    UserNode -->|Answers 30 Questions| Browser
    Browser -->|POST /rekomendasi| Server

    %% Flow 3: Logic and Decision Making
    subgraph BackendLogic [Decision Making Process Backend]
        Server -->|Pass Form Data| Engine
        
        %% Forward Chaining Logic
        Engine -->|Initialize Scores| ZeroScores["Scores: R=0, I=0, A=0, S=0, E=0, C=0"]
        Engine -->|Iterate Questions| CheckAnswers{Check Response}
        
        CheckAnswers -->|Answer = Yes| FireRule[Fire Rule - Condition matches]
        FireRule -->|Add Points| UpdateScore[Update RIASEC Score]
        CheckAnswers -->|Answer = No| NextQ[Next Question]
        
        UpdateScore --> NextQ
        NextQ -->|All Questions Done?| CalcSim[Calculate Similarity]
        
        %% Recommendation Logic
        CalcSim -->|Load Major Profiles| KB
        CalcSim -->|Vector Comparison| CosineSim[Cosine Similarity Calculation]
        CosineSim -->|User Vector vs. Major Vector| ScoreResult["Match Score (0-10)"]
        
        ScoreResult -->|Sort All Majors| Ranking[Rank by Score Descending]
        Ranking -->|Select Top 3| Top3[Get Top 3 Majors]
    end

    %% Flow 4: Result
    Top3 -->|Return Results| Server
    Server -->|Render Result Page| Browser
    Browser -->|Show Recommendations| UserNode

    %% Flow 5: AI Analysis (Optional)
    UserNode -->|Clicks Analisis AI| Browser
    Browser -->|POST /analyze_ai| Server
    
    subgraph AIDecision [AI Decision Process]
        Server -->|Construct Prompt| PromptData[User Scores and Top Majors]
        PromptData -->|API Request| LLM
        LLM -->|Analyze Profiles| Reasoning[Generate Reasoning and Alt Recs]
        Reasoning -->|JSON Response| Server
    end
    
    Server -->|Return JSON| Browser
    Browser -->|Update UI with AI Analysis| UserNode

    %% Styling
    classDef actorStyle fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef systemStyle fill:#e1f5fe,stroke:#0277bd,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef dataStyle fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#fbc02d,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef logicStyle fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:2px;
    
    class UserNode actorStyle;
    class Server,Browser,Engine,LLM systemStyle;
    class KB,PromptData,ZeroScores dataStyle;
    class CheckAnswers,CosineSim,Ranking,FireRule logicStyle;
